# Adam emails — LegalAdvice font & table styles (always)

Whenever drafting, composing, or revising **any email to Adam** (HugeShop, LegalAdvice, MGP/DIV, or other projects) — including Gmail drafts, HTML reply files, and “keep as draft” packs — use the **LegalAdvice reply HTML style**. Do not use plain monospace dumps, markdown-only tables, or WhatsApp-style bullet walls as the sendable email body.

Full process (pack layout + Mail.app draft placement): `docs/ai/process/adam-email-drafts.md`.

**Contact:** prefer `adam@hugeshop.com` for HugeShop; follow project-specific Adam contact rules when set.

**Delivery:** always From **`iman.suherman@gmail.com`**; always place in **Gmail Drafts** — never send to Adam from the agent. See `docs/ai/rules/adam-email-gmail-draft-only.mdc`.

